{"title":"2016 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Coordbash)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Coordbash)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Similar_Triangles)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Similar Triangles)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Area)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Area)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Area)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Area)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Coordinate_Bash,_not_as_efficient_as_Solution_1_but_it_works)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Coordinate Bash, not as efficient as Solution 1 but it works)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ff29028b2432b4e2cf3d924ac82114813de066d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=5$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a5322c7f896502c208bbb4a354efc8d212620667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dccdc7a8cf2b85c2ab8fe806ff4c9659986bd04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EB=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/f/f0f0d1a15a2585561d88c536ceb3956d75077430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CG=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, and point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/4402ab2cb45d04e5a2b56c449191e4896e5a227f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF=2$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />. Segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f0f6aa257bd96696d97454bb777b1a283069e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AG}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0f6a692f19a65fe60fe5745826792f3fd1d57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac540003b4d96d7613cbbf4bc74ead4dbbde68fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"35\" height=\"39\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/a/57a2c18476876164c4e52112dd2a0aca51aea7f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]pair A1=(2,0),A2=(4,4); pair B1=(0,4),B2=(5,1); pair C1=(5,0),C2=(0,4);  draw(A1--A2); draw(B1--B2); draw(C1--C2); draw((0,0)--B1--(5,4)--C1--cycle); dot((20/7,12/7)); dot((3.07692307692,2.15384615384)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(3.07692307692,2.15384615384),N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(20/7,12/7),W); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,4), NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(5,4), NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(5,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(5,1),E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(4,4),N);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"208\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e9a842df00804dd7f4c7aba5c49602ebbde2f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}~\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}{16} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}~\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{13} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}~\\frac{9}{82} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}~\\frac{10}{91}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}~\\frac19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"425\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Coordbash.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Coordbash)\">Solution 1 (Coordbash)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Coordbash)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we will define point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> as the origin.  Then, we will find the equations of the following three lines: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c128243ea8125d0bb007b8132dcfa44461df73a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.  The slopes of these lines are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91d53e8ab2d7469db8fdaa91fb736e3dd307632b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/6/216a650857a17b71cdf212d07c90bb34054efcc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, respectively.  Next, we will find the equations of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c128243ea8125d0bb007b8132dcfa44461df73a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.  They are as follows:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a94eddf84805e63d1d17af56236727d8f4a426.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AG = f(x) = -\\frac{3}{5}x + 4\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/4658f3425def6217f711061c8255b81287158145.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AC = g(x) = -\\frac{4}{5}x + 4\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea3ffae2fb0e3136e0caf616123e0b8ec0ae6a2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[EF = h(x) = 2x - 4\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />\nAfter drawing in altitudes to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e525b776c49bbe7d0ae66cfc7ab8f58f40624e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c0502e0259fb77621bb42640449454f9ad00cda0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{EF} = \\frac{P&#39;Q&#39;}{E&#39;F}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" /> because of similar triangles, and so we only need to find the x-coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/8/f38ddd9b2b43cc8a60e79519667e83c875c1592f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A1=(2,0),A2=(4,4); pair B1=(0,4),B2=(5,1); pair C1=(5,0),C2=(0,4);  pair D1=(20/7,0),D2=(20/7,12/7); pair E1=(40/13,0),E2=(40/13,28/13); pair F1=(4,0),F2=(4,4); draw(A1--A2); draw(B1--B2); draw(C1--C2); draw(D1--D2,dashed); draw(E1--E2,dashed); draw(F1--F2,dashed); draw((0,0)--B1--(5,4)--C1--cycle); dot((20/7,12/7)); dot((3.07692307692,2.15384615384)); dot((20/7,0)); dot((40/13,0)); dot((4,0)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(3.07692307692,2.15384615384),N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(20/7,12/7),W); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,4), NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(5,4), NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(5,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(5,1),E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(4,4),N); label(&quot;$P&#39;$&quot;, (20/7,0),SSW); label(&quot;$Q&#39;$&quot;, (40/13,0),SSE); label(&quot;$E&#39;$&quot;, (4,0),S);  dot(A1); dot(A2); dot(B1); dot(B2); dot(C1); dot(C2); dot((0,0)); dot((5,4));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"212\" />\nFinding the intersections of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c128243ea8125d0bb007b8132dcfa44461df73a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c128243ea8125d0bb007b8132dcfa44461df73a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> gives the x-coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/5449c0dd8c095f7c172728bd25e4c6ea4d025ae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/9/249573c775d954c4c7256b59dd253346c5c05418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" />.  This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1ea463140ef9016f2ce3af34d8d112185dd2e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P&#39;Q&#39; = DQ&#39; - DP&#39; = \\frac{40}{13} - \\frac{20}{7} = \\frac{20}{91}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"289\" height=\"38\" />.  Now we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/8619ffe3a929f2cfc27358969fe1086dc60f1779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{EF} = \\frac{P&#39;Q&#39;}{E&#39;F} = \\frac{\\frac{20}{91}}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~\\frac{10}{91}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"237\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Similar_Triangles.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Similar_Triangles)\">Solution 2 (Similar Triangles)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Similar Triangles)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b455ac7d872c3d7252d88bd682214690b9760cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  pair A1=(2,0),A2=(4,4); pair B1=(0,4),B2=(5,1); pair C1=(5,0),C2=(0,4);  pair H = (20/3,0); draw(A1--A2); draw(B1--B2); draw(C1--C2); draw(B1--H); draw((0,0)--H); draw((0,0)--B1--(5,4)--C1--cycle); dot((20/7,12/7)); dot((3.07692307692,2.15384615384)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(3.07692307692,2.15384615384),N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(20/7,12/7),W); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,4), NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(5,4), NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(5,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(5,1),E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(4,4),N); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,H,E);   [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"165\" />\n</p><p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> to intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c21506f2b6969683f2367e440c159991a832fcf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\overline{HC}$\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/d/95db1b42ba871c52c5caf9b15f21f31aad43c087.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\triangle{HCG}\\sim\\triangle{HDA}\\implies \\dfrac{\\overline{HC}}{\\overline{CG}}=\\dfrac{\\overline{HD}}{\\overline{AD}}\\implies \\dfrac{x}{1}=\\dfrac{x+5}{4}\\implies x=\\dfrac{5}{3}.\\]\" width=\"525\" height=\"41\" /> \n</p><p>Then, notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bc2790d35ad3916fed69ea25a78d87fe7c678ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{AEQ}\\sim\\triangle{HFQ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/6/cc672d99134f475f8dbbbeb287e570f78c9fc033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{AEP}\\sim\\triangle{CFP}$\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/9/f2900f11466d2c50b9ed2af848feb38816a2f3f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{AE}{HF}=\\dfrac{EQ}{QF}\\implies \\dfrac{AE}{HF} = \\dfrac{4}{3+\\frac{5}{3}} = \\dfrac{12}{14}=\\dfrac{6}{7}\\implies \\dfrac{EQ}{EF}=\\dfrac{6}{13}\\]\" width=\"455\" height=\"44\" /> \nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d88338566a96864fa3d1a88247569febe3cadab5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{AE}{CF}=\\dfrac{EP}{FP} \\implies \\dfrac{4}{3}=\\dfrac{EP}{FP}\\implies \\dfrac{FP}{EF} = \\dfrac{3}{7}.\\]\" width=\"330\" height=\"37\" /> \nThus, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0bfcc421e8b71e42f9c3c65e02649fedbb21aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{PQ}{EF} = 1-\\left(\\dfrac{6}{13}+\\dfrac{3}{7}\\right) = 1-\\left(\\dfrac{42+39}{91}\\right) = 1-\\left(\\dfrac{81}{91}\\right) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~ \\dfrac{10}{91}}.\\]\" width=\"490\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 3 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the opposite sides of a rectangle are parallel and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1d954ff85dd2fb5cefdf52cdabd5bb0bfe33e97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{APE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e82c08355af526596d97bb0ce0b73daf7f99697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{CPF}$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> due to vertical angles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/3/1430df5f2940f278b4c7630dbcebf9bbef5abed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{APE}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/5/e55156a4008b0944ad00d5bc71bc5aa6315aabb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sim$\" style=\"vertical-align: 2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"5\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c71c9e4005cbc3dcde5b17a60400ff221f5368.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{CPF}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />. Furthermore, the ratio between the side lengths of the two triangles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/926de00a6bb4176ce96db0fae7b2563441b670fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AE}{FC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"31\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b33bd495b7492f95385da7afb197cd34638cdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />. Labeling <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/6/f06175de06075b060abdf04ebd2ecfe88e58fc97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EP$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24ad2dad196a24708c4c056a01a28329e79688d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FP$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c128243ea8125d0bb007b8132dcfa44461df73a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> turns out to be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d8dd5f375b5f3874868d24a8820fe854a68a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. Since the denominator of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac540003b4d96d7613cbbf4bc74ead4dbbde68fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"35\" height=\"39\" /> must now be a multiple of 7, the only possible solution in the answer choices is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/73142a3e4553b64595f924faf5a8b1b9bc003eb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~\\frac{10}{91}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"69\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Area.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Area)\">Solution 4 (Area)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Area)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e741f22f7780987e9d38d2ecd4d51edcb711b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{EP}{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"35\" height=\"39\" /> using similar triangle, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/8/15809c6b4a71bcf52237df303debc028ff8e7c67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{EQ}{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"35\" height=\"39\" /> using ratio of area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723998405b9fbb46906c9c76e269e18c4e3934e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4cae83c0fa7a0b33f58a5ec88e27c870c017a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3582126294edce1f163a1127c6eca78f1fe413.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]pair A1=(2,0),A2=(4,4); pair B1=(0,4),B2=(5,1),B3=(4,4); pair C1=(5,0),C2=(0,4),C3=(2,0); draw(A1--A2); draw(B1--B2); draw(B2--B3); draw(C1--C2); draw(C2--C3); draw(A1--B2); draw((0,0)--B1--(5,4)--C1--cycle); dot((20/7,12/7)); dot((3.07692307692,2.15384615384)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(3.07692307692,2.15384615384),N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(20/7,12/7),W); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,4), NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(5,4), NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(5,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(2,0),S);  label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(5,1),E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(4,4),N);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"208\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f60ec82ab850e332afa47587b0c8bb87904c679.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\triangle AEP \\sim \\triangle CFP, \\frac{AE}{CF}=\\frac{EP}{FP}, \\frac{EP}{FP}=\\frac{4}{3}, \\frac{EP}{EF}=\\frac{4}{7}\\]\" width=\"390\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae4bcc5f9d5afd582522402493c9550ee37a44b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[AEG]=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 4\\cdot 3=6\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/7320bacbeb14b5ecbbf660e300a4fe1a1b88e77d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[AFG]=[ABCD]-[ADF]-[CFG]-[ABG]=20-4-\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{15}{2}=7\\]\" width=\"506\" height=\"38\" />\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723998405b9fbb46906c9c76e269e18c4e3934e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4cae83c0fa7a0b33f58a5ec88e27c870c017a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> share the same base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/6/d6620da78379131a068e2dcd423a4734a23b7781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{[AEG]}{[AFG]}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"58\" height=\"45\" /> is equal to the ratio of the altitude of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723998405b9fbb46906c9c76e269e18c4e3934e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> to that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4cae83c0fa7a0b33f58a5ec88e27c870c017a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, which is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/2/5a252fbae2d5d0ec7fbf6f2d817bce7427471b37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{EQ}{QF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"35\" height=\"43\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef29de7415631207d8ee08e04f0a0b2673db420.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{[AEG]}{[AFG]}=\\frac{EQ}{QF}=\\frac{6}{7}\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d161c72ad2fe954c6368fec99bc757ef7ef6964.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{EQ}{EF}=\\frac{6}{13}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7e86978b5685c4801d632e5d5899990de801e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{EF}=\\frac{EP}{EF}-\\frac{EQ}{EF}=\\frac{4}{7}-\\frac{6}{13}=\\frac{10}{91}\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/befee741e9601ba72946eb9b82856dd7668e83bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{EF}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~\\frac{10}{91}}\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Area.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Area)\">Solution 5 (Area)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Area)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/5164c9b439932135ba3bb68e7afcff66cb84348f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{QE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"35\" height=\"43\" /> using the ratio of area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/6/9e63687c1c61bf04b3661d0f7742ca43fc05bb4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle APG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723998405b9fbb46906c9c76e269e18c4e3934e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe9d136c45d4232ad15cb5347c7d33bae64f27ff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]pair A1=(2,0),A2=(4,4); pair B1=(0,4),B2=(5,1),B3=(20/7,12/7); pair C1=(5,0),C2=(0,4);  draw(A1--A2); draw(B1--B2); draw(C1--C2); draw(A2--B2); draw(B2--B3); draw((0,0)--B1--(5,4)--C1--cycle); dot((20/7,12/7)); dot((3.07692307692,2.15384615384)); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,(3.07692307692,2.15384615384),N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,(20/7,12/7),W); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,4), NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(5,4), NE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(5,0),SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,(5,1),E); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(4,4),N);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"208\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/e/08ea9b37d87b0aa4ed7ce05c0e66c963ae0d1c57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ACG]=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 5 \\cdot 1 = \\frac{5}{2}\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40ebfeb2d6ba24b705fba37f1fc061dc4cd3796.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[CAB]=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 5 \\cdot 4=10\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e14a98364ebe631716950d3bfafe3c4a43b153.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\triangle AEP \\sim \\triangle CFP\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/6/7363f960f3dc1fd2ae0472c928287e51bdb0f444.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CP}{AP}=\\frac{CF}{AE}=\\frac{3}{4}\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/1/cd19c9702c3926aafd2cf1f470d5c4a9e8febdd8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{CP}{AC}=\\frac{3}{7}\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a77c69acabb53c7d29802a11d0599b933b764eea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{[CPG]}{[CAB]}=\\frac{CP}{CA} \\cdot \\frac{CG}{CB}=\\frac{3 \\cdot 1}{7 \\cdot 4}=\\frac{3}{28}\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e2f58210873b5dd29e585063059b2c64551977b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[CPG]=\\frac{3}{28} \\cdot [CAB]=\\frac{3}{28} \\cdot 10=\\frac{15}{14}\\]\" width=\"285\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/f/40f6cbaec605d6b56d3b33696aa331047ade6c9a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[APG]=[ACG]-[CPG]=\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{15}{14}=\\frac{35-15}{14}=\\frac{20}{14}=\\frac{10}{7}\\]\" width=\"461\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/9001553b4765f16d34b2b39a62630821b3592936.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[AEG]=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 4 \\cdot 3=6\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"37\" />\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/6/9e63687c1c61bf04b3661d0f7742ca43fc05bb4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle APG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723998405b9fbb46906c9c76e269e18c4e3934e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> share the same base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b7329c41dd1ad72af406c541318526eafee74714.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{[APG]}{[AEG]}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"58\" height=\"45\" /> is equal to the ratio of altitude of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/6/9e63687c1c61bf04b3661d0f7742ca43fc05bb4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle APG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> to that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723998405b9fbb46906c9c76e269e18c4e3934e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, which is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/5164c9b439932135ba3bb68e7afcff66cb84348f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{PQ}{QE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"35\" height=\"43\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d517d0bf6971fd32763d900842dc6dfad019c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{QE}=\\frac{[APG]}{[AEG]}=\\frac{\\frac{10}{7}}{6}=\\frac{10}{42}=\\frac{5}{21}\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/5600e77305d23c7222156cb64012544f6eaaa6b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{PE}=\\frac{5}{21+5}=\\frac{5}{26}\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/9/6c956b125e674fe46ce03025cf08e1a5261c2bcf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PE}{PF}=\\frac{AE}{CF}=\\frac{4}{3}\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/f/aaf6635527db698630c45e9c48a6ecfd1dd1908a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PE}{EF}=\\frac{4}{7}\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0abd634e5a012c3f935b74a18cf6d2cd365d9e56.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{PE} \\cdot \\frac{PE}{EF}  = \\frac{5}{26} \\cdot \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{10}{91}\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/befee741e9601ba72946eb9b82856dd7668e83bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{EF}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~\\frac{10}{91}}\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Coordinate_Bash.2C_not_as_efficient_as_Solution_1_but_it_works.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Coordinate_Bash,_not_as_efficient_as_Solution_1_but_it_works)\">Solution 6 (Coordinate Bash, not as efficient as Solution 1 but it works)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Coordinate Bash, not as efficient as Solution 1 but it works)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We set the points\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/6/216677ac31046a38f98f2ccb98546ab02dc117b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37c1f333e1c0c1297432111be038125a4995c90d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(0, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45ad2dd808c6724a597c5bc0d740bebebcb4ce51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E(4, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/59561d721b54eb3f24a71740a60295564ae40693.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(5, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f3119f0e50a7a2dc8f2bdb2d8a760f0a2df1113e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G(5, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7aa5155a70f3d175bf9e517d5d783f6410ded0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(5, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e62e5de7492b7c618c5991e308c4693914ebaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(2, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />.\nThe equation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc383fb8dea3ef979a12cc82840998d5cda8aa88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-\\frac{4}{5}x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />, the equation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f0f6aa257bd96696d97454bb777b1a283069e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AG}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/d/6cdd824437b8cc2c5367ffd6882a9d862842ab3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-\\frac{3}{5}x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />, and the equation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0f6a692f19a65fe60fe5745826792f3fd1d57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/934e29cc816256da6d3d871587f4b74429025c7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2x-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />. Solving the system of equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0f6a692f19a65fe60fe5745826792f3fd1d57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> to find point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859e3732f444ea9142cca1582712c47b37a19d55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-\\frac{4}{5}x+4=2x-4 \\longrightarrow \\frac{14}{5}x=8 \\longrightarrow x=\\frac{20}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"381\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd1ea5bb163b56ba02d3753cce5105dc60e57439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2x-4=\\frac{12}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />. So the coordinate of point P is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b5036c69a78df8b09114445726a643d24e823b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(\\frac{20}{7}, \\frac{12}{7})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" />. Next find point Q by solving the system of equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f0f6aa257bd96696d97454bb777b1a283069e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AG}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0f6a692f19a65fe60fe5745826792f3fd1d57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{EF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb601416cf62495f51355ff9c51eee567a47049f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(\\frac{40}{13}, \\frac{28}{13})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" />. Using the distance formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/3/463ea227b10ff77c25aae7c60c30ef6ad63858ec.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[PQ=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{40}{13}-\\frac{20}{7}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{28}{13}-\\frac{12}{7}\\right)^{2}}=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{20}{91}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{40}{91}\\right)^{2}}\\]\" width=\"468\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9867d6d8ad63e36a333a65a84b99c80e4d9b36c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\sqrt{\\frac{400}{8281}+\\frac{1600}{8281}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2000}{8281}}=\\frac{20\\sqrt{5}}{91}\\]\" width=\"290\" height=\"43\" /> Also using the distance formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54da5451ddca566c9dbf2f5e4b96f9cfdc3189e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[EF=\\sqrt{\\left(4-2\\right)^{2}+\\left(4-0\\right)^{2}}=\\sqrt{4+16}=\\sqrt{20}=2\\sqrt{5}\\]\" width=\"421\" height=\"32\" /> Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/7810f6c8312b3d34a18f0db741abc2b3233a4b14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{PQ}{EF}=\\frac{\\frac{20\\sqrt{5}}{91}}{2\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{10}{91} \\Longrightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~\\frac{10}{91}}\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"49\" />\n~JH. L\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GrCtzL0S-Uo?t=911\">https://youtu.be/GrCtzL0S-Uo?t=911</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B\" title=\"2016 AMC 10B\">2016 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2016 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2016 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" sty